    <div class="marquee-sep">·</div>
  </div>
</div>



<section class="section live-network-section" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);">
  <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 1;">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="label">Live Network</span>
      <h2>Mainnet <span class="gradient-text">Telemetry</span></h2>
      <p>Real-time data from the SIKKA mainnet. No history, no fees, no compromise.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      
      <div class="bento-card bento-4 dash-stat-card reveal reveal-delay-1" style="min-height: 180px;">
        <div class="dash-3d-bg" id="canvas-dag-size"></div>
        <div style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
          <div class="dash-label">Checkpoint Height</div>
          <div class="dash-value blue" id="dash-height">—</div>
          <div class="dash-sub" id="dash-height-label">Finalized checkpoints</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      
      <div class="bento-card bento-4 dash-stat-card reveal reveal-delay-2" style="min-height: 180px;">
        <div class="dash-3d-bg" id="canvas-tips"></div>
        <div style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
          <div class="dash-label">Mempool</div>
          <div class="dash-value purple" id="dash-mempool">—</div>
          <div class="dash-sub">Pending transactions</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      
      <div class="bento-card bento-4 dash-stat-card reveal reveal-delay-3" style="min-height: 180px;">
        <div class="dash-3d-bg" id="canvas-health"></div>
        <div style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
          <div class="dash-label">Network Health</div>
          <div class="dash-value cyan" id="dash-health-value">100%</div>
          <div class="dash-sub">Uptime & Sync status</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      
      <div class="bento-card bento-8 reveal reveal-delay-4" style="min-height: 380px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2);">
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 1.5rem; left: 1.5rem; z-index: 10; pointer-events: none;">
          <div class="dash-label" style="color: var(--cyan); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(34,211,238,0.5);">Global Topology</div>
          <div class="dash-sub" style="color: #fff;">Live transaction stream</div>
        </div>
        <div id="canvas-topology" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute; inset: 0;"></div>
      </div>

      
      <div class="bento-card bento-4 reveal reveal-delay-5" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div class="dash-label">Credit Regeneration</div>
        <div class="dash-chart" style="flex: 1; margin-top: 0; min-height: 100px;">
          <canvas id="chart-pow"></canvas>
        </div>
        <div class="dash-label" style="margin-top: 1rem;">TX Status</div>
        <div class="dash-chart" style="flex: 1; margin-top: 0; min-height: 100px;">
          <canvas id="chart-status"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section" id="architecture">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="label">Architecture</span>
      <h2>Traditional Crypto vs. <span class="gradient-text">SIKKA</span></h2>
      <p>Most cryptocurrencies serialize every transaction into a permanent public ledger. SIKKA keeps account balances and discards the transaction history.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-grid reveal">
      <div class="compare-col">
        <div class="compare-head">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-link"></i>
          Traditional Crypto
        </div>
        <div class="compare-rows">
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> Every transfer stored permanently on-chain</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> Transaction history is public</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> Block size / gas limits throughput</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> Fees required to include transactions</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> Classical ECDSA (quantum-vulnerable)</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> Privacy is optional / bolt-on</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i> Complex multisig via scripts</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i> Heavy client storage</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-col highlight">
        <div class="compare-head" style="color:var(--blue-2);">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
          SIKKA
        </div>
        <div class="compare-rows">
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Account-based balances, not a public log</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Checkpoint batches, round-robin proposer</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Finality via ≥2/3 bonded-stake vote</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Zero fees — protocol enforced</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> ML-DSA-87 post-quantum signatures</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Native m-of-n multisig (up to 16)</div>
          <div class="compare-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> No public transaction history</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-1);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="label">Transaction Lifecycle</span>
      <h2>From wallet to <span class="gradient-text">Finality</span></h2>
      <p>Every SIKKA transaction follows a deterministic lifecycle before it is batched into a finalized checkpoint.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flow reveal">
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-step-num">Step 01</div>
        <div class="flow-step-title">Build TX</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">Wallet assembles a transfer — kind, from, to, amount (CHILLAR), nonce, timestamp, and chain id — over the SIKKA/tx/v3 wire format.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-step-num">Step 02</div>
        <div class="flow-step-title">Spend a Credit</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">Each account burns 1 spend credit (+1/min, cap 100) to rate-limit spam. No proof-of-work required.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-step-num">Step 03</div>
        <div class="flow-step-title">Sign (ML-DSA-87)</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">All signers apply ML-DSA-87 signatures. Multisig: up to 16 parties sign collaboratively.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-step-num">Step 04</div>
        <div class="flow-step-title">Broadcast</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">Submitted to any node via HTTP API. Node validates and gossips to peers.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-step-num">Step 05</div>
        <div class="flow-step-title">Finalize</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">Transactions are batched into a checkpoint. Once ≥2/3 of the bonded stake votes, it finalizes — the state root is signed and the raw txs are discarded.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:3rem;">
      <div style="background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.5rem;" class="reveal">
        <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:1rem;">Checkpoint finality — cumulative bonded-stake quorum</div>
        <div class="chart-wrap lg">
          <canvas id="chart-finality"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="label">Consensus</span>
      <h2>Checkpoint <span class="gradient-text">Finality</span></h2>
      <p>SIKKA uses bonded-stake checkpoint voting. A round-robin proposer batches transactions, validators vote, and the checkpoint finalizes once ≥2/3 of the active bonded stake agrees. At that point the state root is signed and the transactions are discarded.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;align-items:start;" class="reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="finality-steps">
          <div class="finality-step">
            <div class="finality-step-label">Proposer chosen</div>
            <div class="finality-step-bar-wrap"><div class="finality-step-bar" style="width:20%"></div></div>
            <div class="finality-step-pct">round-robin</div>
          </div>
          <div class="finality-step">
            <div class="finality-step-label">Votes open</div>
            <div class="finality-step-bar-wrap"><div class="finality-step-bar" style="width:45%"></div></div>
            <div class="finality-step-pct"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="finality-step">
            <div class="finality-step-label">Quorum</div>
            <div class="finality-step-bar-wrap"><div class="finality-step-bar" style="width:67%"></div></div>
            <div class="finality-step-pct">≥2/3 bonded</div>
          </div>
          <div class="finality-step">
            <div class="finality-step-label">Finalize</div>
            <div class="finality-step-bar-wrap"><div class="finality-step-bar" style="width:100%"></div></div>
            <div class="finality-step-pct">signed root</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:0.83rem;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:1rem;line-height:1.6;">If the proposer is slow, automatic 10-second timeout fallbacks keep the chain moving. Downtime never burns stake — only double-signing (equivocation) is slashed.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="card reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
          <div class="bento-icon cyan" style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-shuffle"></i></div>
          <div style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Non-Punitive Consensus</div>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem;">Validators rotate as proposer on a round-robin schedule with automatic 10-second timeouts. Missing a turn never costs stake; only equivocation — signing two conflicting checkpoints — is slashed. This keeps participation cheap and honest.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="bento-icon green" style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i></div>
          <div style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Deterministic Finality</div>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem;">Finality is solely a function of bonded stake and checkpoint height — computed with 128-bit fixed-point integer math. Every honest node converges on the identical finalized state root, with no floating-point divergence between CPUs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-1);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="label">Tokenomics</span>
      <h2>Deterministic <span class="gradient-text">Low Inflation</span></h2>
      <p>19,960,907 CHILLAR at genesis. Validators earn 1.5%/year inflation on bonded stake. No mining rewards. No premine.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;align-items:center;" class="reveal">
      <div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">
          <div class="card-glow">
            <div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Genesis Supply</div>
            <div style="font-size:2.8rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.05em;" class="gradient-text">19,960,907</div>
            <div style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:0.25rem;">SIKKA — grows with 1.5%/yr validator inflation</div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;">
            <div class="card">
              <div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:0.35rem;">Inflation</div>
              <div style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--green);">1.5%/yr</div>
              <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-3);">On bonded stake, deterministic</div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:0.35rem;">Premine</div>
              <div style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--green);">None</div>
              <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-3);">100% to operators</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-glow">
            <div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Escrowed, Fixed Supply</div>
            <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.04em;" data-vesting-balance class="gradient-text">—</div>
            <div style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:0.25rem;">SIKKA locked in the <a href="https://etherscan.io/address/0xe4a5F67529D40ACFf666303Dd0b6f72A734198B3" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--cyan);">vesting contract</a> (live) — releases 1 SIKKA every 4 seconds, cannot be withdrawn all at once.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.65;">The genesis transaction issued 19,960,907 SIKKA to operators and minters. There are no block rewards or premine. Validators earn a deterministic 1.5%/year inflation, compounded with 128-bit fixed-point math and shared bond-weighted across the active set — no floating-point divergence between CPUs. The number 19,960,907 references the date of a significant cryptographic event — a nod to the math behind post-quantum security.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div style="background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.75rem;">
          <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:1rem;">Supply distribution</div>
          <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:220px;">
            <canvas id="chart-supply"></canvas>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.6rem;font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--text-2);">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-bottom:0.6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
              <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--blue);flex-shrink:0;"></span>Node Operators</span>
              <strong style="color:var(--text);">100%</strong>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;">
              <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid var(--border);"></span>Team / VC / Foundation</span>
              <strong style="color:var(--green);">0%</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-1);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="label">Use Cases</span>
      <h2>Built for <span class="gradient-text">Everyone</span></h2>
      <p>Whether you're a human, an AI agent, or a microcontroller — SIKKA handles the transaction.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="usecase-bento">
      <div class="usecase-card featured reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="usecase-emoji">🤖</div>
        <div class="usecase-title">AI Agent Payments</div>
        <div class="usecase-desc">Autonomous agents can pay for APIs, data feeds, compute resources and services instantly with zero fees. No wallet friction, no gas estimation — just value transfer at machine speed.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:1rem;"><span class="tag blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Zero fees</span> <span class="tag purple"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> ML-DSA-87</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="usecase-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="usecase-emoji">🌍</div>
        <div class="usecase-title">Global Micropayments</div>
        <div class="usecase-desc">Send fractions of SIKKA globally. Every satoshi arrives intact — no fee deductions, no minimum amounts.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="usecase-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="usecase-emoji">🔐</div>
        <div class="usecase-title">Multisig Escrow</div>
        <div class="usecase-desc">Up to 16-of-16 native multisig. Perfect for trustless escrow, DAOs, and collaborative custody without smart contracts.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="usecase-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="usecase-emoji">🕵️</div>
        <div class="usecase-title">Private Transfers</div>
        <div class="usecase-desc">Built-in privacy by default — no opt-in required.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="usecase-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="usecase-emoji">💻</div>
        <div class="usecase-title">IoT & Edge Devices</div>
        <div class="usecase-desc">17 MB static binary. Runs on minimal hardware. Machine-to-machine payments for sensor networks and edge compute.</div>
